        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSB35R4x-R, 3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x 1/4 Radius Residential Solid Brass Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws and standard removable button tip finials. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tr class=\"text\">\r\n<td width=\"304\" align=\"left\"\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3-1/2 Inch Residential Brass Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 1/4\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB35R4-specifications.pdf?v=1691095360\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSB35R4 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\">finishes</a> for this hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't forget to look at <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinge-finials\">Deltana's Hinge Finial Tips</a> to spice up your hinges!\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"296\" align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB35R4-specifications.jpg?v=1704354642\" width=\"296\" height=\"272\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSB35R4 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
